1
00:00:00,296 --> 00:00:02,666
(Dr Gallo:)from a prescription
for anxiety.

2
00:00:02,665 --> 00:00:04,635
(Penny:)Okay, if you think it'll help.

3
00:00:04,634 --> 00:00:06,164
(Penny:)Oh, just don't
make it Placinex.

4
00:00:06,169 --> 00:00:08,769
(Penny:)I do not need
sudden fits of homicidal rage.

5
00:00:12,542 --> 00:00:14,372
(Amy(on Skype):)I miss you.

6
00:00:14,377 --> 00:00:16,007
(Sheldon:)I miss you as well.

7
00:00:16,012 --> 00:00:18,082
(Howard:)I can't believe
I miss Stuart.

8
00:00:18,081 --> 00:00:20,881
(Penny:)I guess I just miss
when life was simpler.

9
00:00:20,883 --> 00:00:22,753
GIRLS (chanting):
Go, Leonard! Go, Leonard!

10
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:24,052
(Girls:)Go, Leonard!
Go, Leonard!

11
00:00:24,053 --> 00:00:27,223
(Leonard:)Remember, girls, you decide
what makes you happy,

12
00:00:27,223 --> 00:00:29,823
(Leonard:)not your emotionally
withholding mothers.

13
00:00:29,826 --> 00:00:31,826
GIRLS (chanting):
Go, Leonard! Go, Leonard!

14
00:00:31,828 --> 00:00:35,058
(Girls:)Go, Leonard! Go, Leonard!
Go, Leonard!

15
00:00:48,025 --> 00:00:50,035
(whispers):
I really miss this.

